    "poisonous? no, that sounds wrong.\n\nwait, let me keep it simple and positive.\n\nthe animal i'd protect above all others is the **ape**.\n\nwhy? because they are our closest living relatives. their loss would tear a hole right into the human story itself. it feels like being asked to save yourself all over again.\n\nand just to be clear: i wouldn't say *crocodile* (despite the cool scales), or *penguin* (too many already struggling just to walk in the snow). the apes are the real choice here.\n\nbut if you're looking for something with a louder voice\u2014and i mean something that can roar with a heart of pure, untamed fire\u2014then i'd choose the **lion**.\n\nno other animal captures the essence of \"king of the jungle\" quite like this. it's the only one that truly commands respect from start to finish.\n\nso, the answer is: **lion": 1,
